            "title": "STEM: Balloon Car Derby",
            "description": "<p>Build two different types of balloon cars for our balloon car derby where lessons learned about engineering design, and kinetic and potential energy can be incorporated to create the fastest car.</p>\n<p>Experiment with different materials and angles to create the fastest and&nbsp;straightest-driving car. And don't forget to make it look cool with stickers and washi tape.<br></p>\n<p>Program recommended for Elementary School Students 5 to 10 years old.</p>\n<p><strong>Space is limited on a first-come, first-served basis.&nbsp;We will hand out 12 tickets for this event 30 minutes before the program at 12:30 p.m.</strong></p>\n<p><u><a href=\"https://www.sjpl.org/ada-event-accommodation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-auth=\"NotApplicable\" id=\"OWA98e1b189-6d04-643f-141c-06bba56b4b13\" data-linkindex=\"0\" title=\"https://www.sjpl.org/ada-event-accommodation/\">ADA Accommodation Requests</a></u></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>",
